sequenceDiagram
    participant Temporal
    participant Pipeline
    participant Extractor
    participant Policy as Policy Enforcement
    participant Adapter
    participant Source

    Temporal->>Pipeline: Execute extraction activity
    Pipeline->>Extractor: extract(context, resource)
    Extractor->>Policy: Validate authorization
    Policy-->>Extractor: Authorized
    Extractor->>Adapter: Fetch raw data
    Adapter->>Source: Query source system
    Source-->>Adapter: Raw data
    Adapter-->>Extractor: Raw data
    Extractor-->>Pipeline: Raw record
    Pipeline-->>Temporal: Extraction complete
